  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect a Colombian Child From Sexual Exploitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports children affected by, and at risk of, conflict-related sexual violence and commercial sexual exploitation of children (CSEC) in the cities of Quibdo, Cartagena and Bogota by strengthening the capacities of children and young people to overcome the trauma they suffer as a result of their experiences and to help them understand how to protect themselves from future violence. This project is implemented by two of our partner organizations: CDE and ACJ.</narrative>
  </description>
